[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SSS011
TITLE: Each simulated aircraft shall publish a truth track
STATEMENT: >>>
The system shall publish a truth track for each simulated aircraft at every motion step. The track shall carry the aircraft identity, position, velocity, altitude, wake class, and time. Publishing a track shall not by itself issue a clearance. Acceptance is two aircraft whose tracks update on the same step and stay distinct, with the issued-clearance log unchanged by the publication.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Routine prediction needs one shared picture of where each aircraft is. The picture is not a clearance.
<<<
DAL: B
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: System
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The checked envelope is 4 runways, 8 aircraft under control, and 2 neighbor airports. A training profile may publish tracks for a larger picture and does not change the checked envelope. This is simulation software, with no live NAS connection and no certification claim.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
